Description: Secure OpenVPN profile manager for GTK4 desktops
 eOVPN-Pro imports OpenVPN profiles from private local storage or HTTPS,
 performs honest TCP latency measurements, filters and favorites servers,
 and manages only the NetworkManager UUIDs created by the application.
 .
 The package includes Persian localization and right-to-left layout support.
 Public IP lookup is opt-in and imported profiles are stored with restrictive
 filesystem permissions.
